## 💰 MONETIZATION (STRICT FREEMIUM)

### Free Plan (Intentionally Frustrating)
```typescript
const freePlanLimits = {
  conversationsPerMonth: 2, // NOT 3, make it restrictive
  maxDurationPerConversation: 5, // minutes (hard cutoff)
  scenariosAccess: ['introduction'], // ONLY 1 scenario
  languageAccess: 'msa', // MSA only, no Darija
  voiceMode: false, // Text only
  correctionsType: 'end_of_conversation', // Not real-time
  saveHistory: 7, // days, then deleted
  exportVocabulary: false,
  offlineMode: false,
  watermark: 'Plan Gratuit - Limite 2 conversations/mois', // Persistent UI badge
};

// Rate limiting middleware
async function checkFreePlanLimits(userId: string): Promise<boolean> {
  const user = await getUser(userId);
  if (user.plan !== 'free') return true;
  
  const thisMonth = await getConversationCount(userId, 'current_month');
  
  if (thisMonth >= 2) {
    throw new Error('FREE_LIMIT_REACHED');
  }
  return true;
}
```

### Premium Plan (9.99€/month)
