- [ ] Test rate limiting (hit free plan limit)
- [ ] Test payment flow (Stripe test mode)
- [ ] Test error states (API failures)
- [ ] Test offline mode (premium users)
- [ ] Lighthouse score > 90
- [ ] No console errors

### Beta Testing Checklist
- [ ] 5 native Arabic speakers test conversations
- [ ] 5 French/English learners test onboarding
- [ ] Collect feedback on correction frequency
- [ ] Verify avatar is culturally appropriate
- [ ] Test on iOS Safari (PWA quirks)
- [ ] Test on Android Chrome
- [ ] Verify Stripe webhooks in production

