## 🎨 DESIGN PRINCIPLES

1. **Bold & Distinctive**: No generic AI aesthetics
2. **Culturally Respectful**: Islamic design patterns, halal-compliant
3. **Arabic-First**: RTL properly implemented, beautiful Arabic typography
4. **Immersive**: Backgrounds + ambient sounds = presence
5. **Encouraging**: Corrections are gentle, not punitive
6. **Mobile-Optimized**: Most users on phones
7. **Fast**: < 2s page load, instant UI feedback

---

## 🔄 ITERATION PRIORITIES

### After MVP Launch (Week 1-2)
1. Fix critical bugs from beta
2. Add 2-3 more beginner scenarios
3. Improve correction explanations (user feedback)
4. Add pronunciation tips (text-based, not audio yet)

### Month 2
1. Implement voice mode (STT/TTS)
2. Add all intermediate scenarios
3. Build spaced repetition system
4. Stripe integration + premium features

### Month 3
1. Advanced scenarios
2. Gamification (streaks, badges)
3. Referral program (get 1 month free)
4. Marketing push (Reddit, Facebook groups)

### Month 4-6
1. iOS/Android native apps (React Native - after formation)
2. Web version optimization
3. B2B partnerships (language schools)
4. Content expansion (cultural lessons)

