## ✅ DEFINITION OF DONE (MVP)

An MVP is complete when:
- [x] User can sign up with Google/Apple
- [x] User can select MSA or Darija
- [x] User can select beginner level
- [x] User can start "Introduction" scenario
- [x] User can type messages in Arabic
- [x] Claude AI responds naturally in chosen language
- [x] Corrections appear in conversation
- [x] Avatar animates with gestures
- [x] Background matches scenario
- [x] Free plan limit enforced (2 conversations/month)
- [x] Conversation saves to database
- [x] PWA installable on mobile
- [x] Deployed to production (Vercel)
- [x] Zero critical bugs
- [x] Lighthouse score > 85
- [x] Load time < 3s on 3G

